# WazHack/ZX 6x8 font, BOLD variant (round-6 comparison reference; superseded by font6x8.grid thin).
# Format: '=== <code> <char>' + 8 rows of 6 ('#' ink, '.' paper). Cell row 0 is the line gap;
# caps use rows 1-6 (baseline row 6), descenders row 7, lowercase x-height rows 3-6. Column 5
# is the built-in 1-px letter gap and must stay blank. Strokes are 2 px wide wherever the
# 5-px body allows (CRT-safe); 1-px strokes only in M N W m w and diagonals.
# Packed by tools/font_tool.py: 8 B/char, MSB-left, bits 7..2 used (768 B).

